{"name": "Doggy Don't Care", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Doggy Don\u2019t Care is a comedic 3D adventure where you step into the paws of an adorable but mischievous pup! When Charlie\u2019s owner leaves him home alone, it\u2019s his chance to explore, collect, and smash his way through four vibrant, interactive environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles and dig into a howl-arious list of fun-filled shenanigans in an attempt to impress Charlie\u2019s feathered friends, who reward you with \u2728Mischievous Badges\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/3eb9112e38fe29cd57f8d5777ac8561f.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/da4a97194de00ad2d90edc297b59717d.poster.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/da4a97194de00ad2d90edc297b59717d.webm?t=1790287179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/da4a97194de00ad2d90edc297b59717d.mp4?t=1790287179\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charlie has one main mission: to cause as much adorable chaos as possible. By grabbing a roll of toilet paper, he can leave a trail of TP in his path, or by stepping in oil, he can leave paw prints over the roof of his owner\u2019s car. She won\u2019t be mad, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across four vibrant cartoon-style levels, Charlie is free to run amok to his little heart\u2019s content. Be sure to leave no pillow, chair or photo frame unturned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/2a4e599f9b677ed4e4799ce9ac5bfdc1.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7da87a4fa3e50d246f4f3441a19b97d0.poster.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7da87a4fa3e50d246f4f3441a19b97d0.webm?t=1790287179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7da87a4fa3e50d246f4f3441a19b97d0.mp4?t=1790287179\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s fun to cause adorable chaos, but what\u2019s the goal? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage features plenty of badges that reward Charlie\u2019s shenanigans. Each badge is a puzzle for Charlie to solve, all relying on his ability to cause as much mayhem as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/ebcb55108b02366e6d2ed3d041c05a05.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/4f1dc2c7ac2629663aa955b08b88aaa3.poster.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/4f1dc2c7ac2629663aa955b08b88aaa3.webm?t=1790287179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/4f1dc2c7ac2629663aa955b08b88aaa3.mp4?t=1790287179\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Charlie explores, he\u2019ll find plenty of new and adorable pawjama outfits for him to wear. Dress Charlie in an entire puppy closet full of costumes, including a giraffe, a unicorn, or even (heaven forbid) a cat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/004d7ec1f2a96661bb74b7dc64a9581b.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/d4f8bfa9cdef26679b5ec5c39255d132.poster.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/d4f8bfa9cdef26679b5ec5c39255d132.webm?t=1790287179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/d4f8bfa9cdef26679b5ec5c39255d132.mp4?t=1790287179\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wondered what goes on in our dogs' minds when they\u2019re sleeping and their legs start twitching? Explore Charlie\u2019s dreams and uncover their hidden meanings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/ef44d42ccf0f4f4a3d200e4cdab39b88.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc36 A pawsitively chaotic single-player adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 Vibrant 3D cartoon-style graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde6 Adorable pawjama outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Puzzles to solve using found items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50 Earn mischievous badges for being naughty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc26 Impress your feathered friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 You can pee everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Fun for all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the world through a dog's eyes in this game of exploration, problem-solving, and causing mischief. \"Doggy Don't Care\" is your invitation to unleash your inner pup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras_big/e201dec13e6fac70820f2dbf314fac44.avif?t=1790287179\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/e201dec13e6fac70820f2dbf314fac44.avif?t=1790287179\" width=\"800\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "What does your dog get up to when you're not home? In this bone-afide adventure, unleash adorable chaos, solve puzzles, and leave your mark (literally!) as a mischievous pup on the loose.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/460727ca564c53e2982c03604b4a73ffe3d31074/header.jpg?t=1790287179", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Funny", "Cute", "Exploration", "Casual", "3D"], "developers": "Rohan Nowell", "publishers": "Rohan Nowell", "release_date": "Sep 24, 2026", "price": "$13.49", "appid": "2438180", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/xB5SvWthYyY", "first_seen": 1790200800.0, "review_rank": 3}